{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1519832-omens-of-beherit-homebrew-demonic-glitches","id":1519832,"title":"Omens of Beherit (Homebrew Demonic Glitches)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-08-05T02:04:57-07:00","id":1519832,"title":"Omens of Beherit (Homebrew Demonic Glitches)","content":"Due to the sheer age of every other thread here concerning such, I hereby open this thread for the express purpose of the proposal/submittance, discussion of &amp; brainstorming potentially interesting uses for, Glitches. In the name of kicking things off, here\u2019s my attempt at a Catastrophic Glitch of each type;<br /> <br /> Brand - Catastrophic - Rock Tooth - The Unchained\u2019s teeth become chunks of rare, valuable stones, metals &amp;/or gemstones, roughly hewn/knapped/forged into the form of bestial, gap-toothed fangs, forcing them to cover their mouth when they talk, eat by themselves (or in suitably demonic company) &amp; be unable to provide proper teeth-displaying smiles around those unfamiliar with their true heritage &amp; what it entails.<br /> <br /> Tell - Catastrophic - Riddling Logic - The Demon must present any &amp; all questions they seek to ask as some form of riddle or logic puzzle of appropriate difficulty to how important the question\u2019s desired answer is to the Demon, thusly forcing them to carefully consider how they are to approach questioning or interrogating someone personally.<br /> <br /> Emanation - Catastrophic - Escher\u2019s Dust - Any loose granular substances (I.e. dust, sand, flour, sugar) float &amp; shift into 3D shapes with literally impossible geometries upon the Demon\u2019s approach, before collapsing back to the floor in heaps &amp; piles as they leave. This subsequently restricts them to relatively clean, sterile environments when a